Visibility only, no behaviour change: make the deployment's signing key loader
public, so the adapter's `discover` op can build the same PoppyAgent that
worker_poppy_call builds and call PoppyAgent::discover directly. everruns'
`poppy_discover` tool answer leaves out the issuer, which the interop
`discover` result needs. (The protocol module itself is public at this commit.)

